note: batch 13a: a variable two times in one side of a pattern; its first value `(a + b)` has parentheses and its second value `a + b` has none: they are one expression by the syntax tree, so the rewrite holds
rule+: R77.3-6
option: --compiled
option: --same
option: rewrite $x.min($x) => std::cmp::min($x, $x)
must_match: ✓ a1 same: rewrite `\$x\.min\(\$x\)` => `std::cmp::min\(\$x, \$x\)` \(the form holds: 1 site
